  "category": "Eruption Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "CAMERUPT has a volcano inside its body. Magma of 18,000 degrees F courses through its body. Occasionally, the humps on this POKéMON’s back erupt, spewing the superheated magma.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "The humps on CAMERUPT’s back are formed by a transformation of its bones. They sometimes blast out molten magma. This POKéMON apparently erupts often when it is enraged.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "A POKéMON that lives in the crater of a volcano. Every 10 years, the volcanoes on its back erupt violently. Research is under way on the cause of eruption.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "If angered, the humps on its back erupt in a shower of molten lava. It lives in the craters of volcanoes.",
      "version": "firered"
